			"notes": "## Changelog\n\n- Added the option for Iris shader packs to explicitly enable Longview\n  - This can be done by enabling the `longview.enable_reverse_z` and `longview.enable_z_zero_to_one` options in the pack's `shaders.properties` file\n  - Added `LONGVIEW_REVERSE_Z` and `LONGVIEW_Z_ZERO_TO_ONE` shader defines so that shader packs can properly implement Longview support\n    - Note: there is no universal `LONGVIEW` define since not all devices running OpenGL support Zero-to-One Z\n  - This is the first iteration of a way to allow shader packs to support Reverse Z. There may be issues to be fixed on Longview's side, so don't forget to report anything you see!\n- Reworked the icon in order to make the mod's purpose clearer\n- Fixed an incompatibility with VoxelMap Updated by patching the erroneous logic\n- Added Longview's status in the F3 debug information"
		},
